 "summary": "The open-subset density comparison, the pullback/Hom-bundle identification and the total-space fibre-coordinate criterion have no existing counterpart in Mathlib or TauCeti; the closest TauCeti results (`Bundle.Pullback.contMDiff_hom_section_iff`, `contMDiff_fiberwise`) are about sections or fibrewise maps on a single bundle, not total-space maps. The new code reuses `TauCeti.bundleDiffeomorph`, `Bundle.Pullback.contMDiff_iff`/`contMDiff_lift`, `TauCeti.contMDiff_hom_bundle_iff`, `clm_bundle_comp` and `inCoordinates_pullback_of_mem` where they apply.",
